Subject: [PATCH 264/307] !R (Terrain Plate) Group component properties into
 collapsible sections.

Move the flat Terrain Plate property list into Shape, Bake, Weld and Editor
groups while retaining the existing rendering and physics sections.
---
 .../Geometry/TerrainPlateComponent.cpp        |  81 +++++++++
 .../Geometry/TerrainPlateComponent.h          | 157 ++++++++++++++++--
 2 files changed, 221 insertions(+), 17 deletions(-)

